// ESENT events referencing ntds.dit, for Microsoft Sentinel.
// Not run against a live workspace.
//
// Why this is hand-written: the Sigma rule esent-ntds-copy.sigma.yml does not convert
// to KQL. Defender XDR has no table for the raw Windows Application log, so there is
// nothing to convert to. Sentinel keeps it in the Event table, but only if the data
// collection rule forwards the Application log from domain controllers -- which is
// GAP-002 in this hunt.
Event
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| where EventLog == "Application" and Source == "ESENT"
| where EventID in (216, 325, 326, 327)
| where RenderedDescription has "ntds.dit"
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, EventID, RenderedDescription
